  m_text: "5 \xB7 Mesh Collect 3D \u2014 World3D space, Mesh payload\n3D coins arc
    to a collector, facing along their own path with AlignToVelocity.\nTrails work
    here and NOT on a Canvas: a TrailRenderer is a world-space mesh renderer.\nSame
    definition, emission and events as the Canvas scenes \u2014 only space and payload
    differ."
